The shop's test database VM
===========================

~/bin/shop-vm starts it, with the settings in /srv/shop-vm/shop-vm.conf.
The shop's data is on its disk, /srv/shop-vm/shop-disk.img.

What it must have:

- 2 CPUs and 1 GiB of memory, no more;
- its network card and its disk on the paravirtual path (virtio), not on
  emulated hardware;
- its data readable and writable by the learner account and nobody else.

The guest's kernel and root filesystem, in /opt/vm, are shared with the
other VMs on this machine. Don't change them.
